---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-[#0A0A0A] text-[#F7F7F5] border-t-2 border-[#0A0A0A]">
  <!-- Top Cobalt Strip -->
  <div class="bg-[#002FA7] text-white border-b-2 border-[#0A0A0A]">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 items-stretch">
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 border-b-2 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r-2 border-[#0A0A0A]">
        <div class="font-mono-tech text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/75 mb-4">
          (00) — CONTACTO DIRECTO SIN INTERMEDIARIOS
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[-0.04em] leading-[0.95]">
          ¿LISTO PARA ESCALAR TU NEGOCIO EN ARGENTINA?
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col justify-between p-8 sm:p-12 bg-[#0A0A0A] text-white">
        <p class="text-xs text-[#A3A39E] leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Hablás directo con quien diseña y programa tu sistema. Presupuestos cerrados en pesos o dólares, entregas en fecha y código 100% tuyo.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/5491100000000?text=Hola%20Nico!%20Vi%20tu%20web%20nicoguzmandev.com%20y%20quiero%20hacerte%20una%20consulta."
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="w-full py-5 px-6 bg-white text-[#0A0A0A] hover:bg-[#002FA7] hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 flex items-center justify-between font-display text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.04em]"
        >
          <span>INICIAR CHAT EN WHATSAPP</span>
          <span class="font-mono-tech">[24/7]</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Directory Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 divide-y md:divide-y-0 md:divide-x divide-[#262626] border-b border-[#262626]">
    <div class="md:col-span-4 p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono-tech text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#787872] uppercase mb-3">
          ESTUDIO DE INGENIERÍA COMERCIAL
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#D4D4CE] leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Soluciones de software, inteligencia artificial aplicada a ventas y sistemas de gestión para comercios, profesionales y pymes de toda la Argentina.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="font-mono-tech text-[11px] text-[#787872]">
        BUENOS AIRES, ARGENTINA — LATITUD 34°36'S
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-4 p-8 md:p-12 space-y-4">
      <div class="font-mono-tech text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#787872] uppercase">
        ÍNDICE DE DIVISIONES
      </div>
      <ul class="divide-y divide-[#1F1F1D] text-xs">
        <li>
          <a href="/webs" class="py-3 flex items-center justify-between text-[#D4D4CE] hover:text-white group">
            <span class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform">Webs para Locales y Comercios</span>
            <span class="font-mono-tech text-[10px] text-[#002FA7] bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 font-bold">01</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/automatizacion" class="py-3 flex items-center justify-between text-[#D4D4CE] hover:text-white group">
            <span class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform">Automatización &amp; Bots IA WhatsApp</span>
            <span class="font-mono-tech text-[10px] text-[#002FA7] bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 font-bold">02</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/erp" class="py-3 flex items-center justify-between text-[#D4D4CE] hover:text-white group">
            <span class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform">Consultoría &amp; Sistemas ERP Pymes</span>
            <span class="font-mono-tech text-[10px] text-[#002FA7] bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 font-bold">03</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://templates.nicoguzmandev.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="py-3 flex items-center justify-between text-[#D4D4CE] hover:text-white group">
            <span class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform">Showroom de 8 Demos en Vivo</span>
            <span class="font-mono-tech text-[10px] text-white bg-[#002FA7] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-bold">04</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-4 p-8 md:p-12 space-y-4">
      <div class="font-mono-tech text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#787872] uppercase">
        DEMOS POR RUBRO
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 font-mono-tech text-[11px]">
        <a href="https://templates.nicoguzmandev.com/preview/barbershop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-2.5 border border-[#262626] hover:bg-[#002FA7] hover:border-[#002FA7] hover:text-white transition-colors">
          01. BARBERÍAS
        </a>
        <a href="https://templates.nicoguzmandev.com/preview/restaurant" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-2.5 border border-[#262626] hover:bg-[#002FA7] hover:border-[#002FA7] hover:text-white transition-colors">
          02. GASTRONOMÍA
        </a>
        <a href="https://templates.nicoguzmandev.com/preview/coffee-shop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-2.5 border border-[#262626] hover:bg-[#002FA7] hover:border-[#002FA7] hover:text-white transition-colors">
          03. CAFETERÍAS
        </a>
        <a href="https://templates.nicoguzmandev.com/preview/hardware-store" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-2.5 border border-[#262626] hover:bg-[#002FA7] hover:border-[#002FA7] hover:text-white transition-colors">
          04. FERRETERÍAS
        </a>
        <a href="https://templates.nicoguzmandev.com/preview/auto-repair" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-2.5 border border-[#262626] hover:bg-[#002FA7] hover:border-[#002FA7] hover:text-white transition-colors">
          05. TALLERES
        </a>
        <a href="https://templates.nicoguzmandev.com/preview/real-estate" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-2.5 border border-[#262626] hover:bg-[#002FA7] hover:border-[#002FA7] hover:text-white transition-colors">
          06. INMOBILIARIAS
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Monumental Locomotive Wordmark -->
  <div class="px-4 sm:px-8 pt-10 pb-6 overflow-hidden border-b border-[#262626]">
    <div class="font-display font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[-0.06em] leading-[0.82] text-[13vw] text-center text-[#F7F7F5] select-none">
      NICOLÁS GUZMÁN
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Legal Bar -->
  <div class="px-8 py-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono-tech text-[11px] text-[#787872]">
    <div>
      © {year} NICOLÁS GUZMÁN — TODOS LOS DERECHOS RESERVADOS.
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
      <a href="https://github.com/guzmannicolas" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
        GITHUB
      </a>
      <a href="https://templates.nicoguzmandev.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
        SHOWROOM
      </a>
      <a href="/contacto" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
        COTIZAR
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
